 \cdot  \chi(\mathcal{V}, W, p, q). 
\end{multline*}  
In particular, the martingale $(Q_n\mathcal{V}([0,1]))_{n\ge 1}$ is uniformly  bounded in $L^p(\ell^q)$  if and only if the characteristic quantity $\chi(\mathcal{V}, W, p, q)<\infty$.

